OL,3,GNEWSAWhy a Cheshire town wants fewer
OL,4,Acouncillors
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith around 10,000 parish and town
OL,7,Fcouncils across England, more than
OL,8,F100,000 local councillors represent
OL,9,Fthem.
OL,11,FBut one in Cheshire could have fewer
OL,12,Fcouncillors after residents backed
OL,13,Fplans to reduce its size, in a move one
OL,14,Fformer mayor described as "quite
OL,15,Fsensible".
OL,17,FFrodsham Town Council (FTC) currently
OL,18,Fhas 16 councillors, but that could be
OL,19,Freduced to 12 if plans are approved by
OL,20,FCheshire West and Chester Council
OL,21,F(CWAC).
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
