OL,3,GNEWSAWhy a Cheshire town wants fewer
OL,4,Acouncillors
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe proposal follows a request by FTC
OL,7,Ffor CWAC to review how the town council
OL,8,Fis run, although the council has since
OL,9,Fvoted to oppose the change.
